        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AF-D9, Paddle Lever with Oval Floral Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe ornate styling of Fusion's Floral Oval Rose is not overwhelmed by a similarly heavy-styled lever. Instead, it is juxtaposed by the classic Paddle Lever. The simplicity of the lever when paired with the highly ornamented rose allows for the true beauty of the leverset to shine; and when matched with one of the 5 stunning finishes, this lever and rose set can really bring out the grandiosity of any room. It will fit 1-1/4\" to 2\" thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AF-D9 Paddle Lever and Oval Floral Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Ornate Door Lever Fusion AF D9:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Paddle Lever With Oval Floral Rose, Fusion AF-D9",
                "description": "Paddle Lever with Floral Oval Rose Fusion AF-D9 - The ornate styling of Fusion's Floral Rose is not overwhelmed by a similarly heavy-styled lever. Instead, it is juxtaposed by the classic Paddle Lever. The simplicity of the lever when paired with the highly ornamented rose allows for the true beauty of the leverset to shine; and when matched with one of the 5 stunning finishes, this lever and rose set can really bring out the grandiosity of any room.  It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
